  m_Name: help_machines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_machines
  displayName: Machines
  order: 220
  category: Building
  icon: building_smelter
  body: 'Machines turn items into better ones: the Smelter makes copper from copper ore (and iron from iron ore and coal), the Archive studies finds into knowledge, the Fungus Garden grows food, and research brings more.


    A machine starts as soon as it has what it needs. Workers bring fresh finds straight to it and fetch its inputs from storage; belts can feed it too. Its products go onto a belt leading away, or wait on its floor for workers. With too many waiting it pauses.


    Point at a machine to see its inputs and progress. {Configure} makes it run one recipe only, or switches it off. In the flow overlay ({Flow}) machines are green while working, yellow while waiting for inputs and red when their products pile up.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
